## Fenced Code Blocks
Sprache nach ``` angeben:

```c
void uart_init(uint32_t base, uint32_t baud) {
    uint16_t divisor = CLOCK_FREQ / (16 * baud);
    outb(base + LCR, 0x80);  // DLAB
    outb(base + DLL, divisor & 0xFF);
    outb(base + DLH, divisor >> 8);
    outb(base + LCR, 0x03);  // 8N1
}
```

